The Apache-2.0 license on this repository covers the packaging only. The
published container image contains one third-party binary, redistributed
under its own license:

  kubectl  Apache-2.0  https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes

The exact version is the image tag, and is recorded in the image's
org.opencontainers.image.version label. The binary is downloaded from
https://dl.k8s.io/release/v<version>/bin/linux/<arch>/kubectl and verified
against the upstream .sha256 at build time.

