The base image is gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot, published by
the Distroless project (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/distroless)
and derived from Debian. It contains ca-certificates, /etc/passwd and
timezone data only; no shell and no package manager. Debian publishes the
corresponding source at https://sources.debian.org/.
